From 0de48edf5f06290ead2f495808cdefb8762d8739 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jialun Chen <169634920+Jialunx@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 22:54:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add SWRT for the nonlinear four-wave interactions
 (INLSCHEME = 1)

SWRT (sparse Webb-Resio-Tracy) computes S_nl from K configurations of the
WRT quadrature table, each with one optimized coefficient, read from the
file named by WAM_SWRT_OPERATOR. The default INLSCHEME = 0 keeps the DIA
of SNONLIN and leaves ecWAM unchanged.

- snonlin_swrt.F90 (new): INISNONLIN_SWRT reads the file and checks it
  against the spectral grid; SNONLIN_SWRT takes the arguments of SNONLIN
  and adds S_nl to SL and its diagonal term to FLD
- yowstat, mpuserin, userin: switch INLSCHEME in namelist NALINE
- initmdl, implsch, wdfluxes: call the SWRT routines when INLSCHEME = 1
- CMakeLists.txt: build the new file
- ecwam_run_model.sh: isnonlin, inlscheme and swrt_operator from the yml
