Subject: [PATCH 3/3] SNONLIN_SWRT: read format version 2 of the operator file

Version 2 adds the blocks full, area and ntoe: rows flagged in full also
change k2 and k4, as a whole quadruplet. Every file in swrt/files is
version 1, for which nothing changes.
---
 src/ecwam/snonlin_swrt.F90 | 109 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 104 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/ecwam/snonlin_swrt.F90 b/src/ecwam/snonlin_swrt.F90
